  sec-approvers ONLY (admin office is not decide authority), so the demo
  shows a real separation of duties (the person who decides holds no agent
  tools, and being admin decides nothing). alice carries the same decider
  package for the solo demo; unassign ivan's and the pool shrinks to her,
  which the console's pool counts show live. An IT Operations decider fits
  deploy tickets and IdM mutations, while erin stays the clean
  access-request / certification candidate, frank the dev-ops manager the
  list_my_managers demo resolves to, and judy the People Ops sample.
-->
